#: ../../../reference/interfaces/pwm-control-interface.md:2
msgid "pwm-control interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/pwm-control-interface.md:4
msgid "`pwm-control` permits control over any aspect of all PWM channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/pwm-control-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"This interface is currently **under development** and has not yet been "
"released for general use. See [ interfaces: add pwm-control interface ]"
"(https://github.com/canonical/snapd/pull/12347) for further details on this "
"work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/pwm-control-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"The `pwm-control` interface can potentially impact the system and other "
"snaps, and allows privileged access to hardware. See {ref}`The pwm interface "
"<interfaces-pwm-interface>` to access a specific channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/pwm-control-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/pwm-control-interface.md:12
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""
